          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nikhurula khumwalo kwaAhawa khunyanga yekhumi nakhabili mumwesi kwambeli, okhutsia eYerusalemu, omukhono kwaNyasaye weefwe nikuba khwifwe, naye nakhuhonokosia mumukhono kwabasuku nabakonesheli abali khunjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikhuula eYerusalemu, nikhwikhalayo tsindaalo tsitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunyanga yakhane ifeetsa tsana neitsahaabu nebimanulwa biachelelwa munzu yaNyasaye weefwe nibihaanwa mumukhono kwaMeremotsi waUria, omukuhani; yali nende Eleazari waFinehasi; nabo bali nende Yozabadi waYeshua, naNoadia waBinui, abaLawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biosi biabalwa nibichelwa, obusiro bwene nibuhandiikwa khushise eshio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
