              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio, abobwarwi abo, nibo abarula mukhwarwa, nibamalila Nyasaye waIsiraeli emisango emisambe, mbu tsisurusi ekhumi natsibili khulwa Isiraeli yosi, namamiiku amakhumi shienda nakasasaba, amakondi kebimwamwane amakhumi musaafu namusaafu, netsikhole ekhumi natsibili khulwa omusango kwobwonooni; ebio biosi biali omusango omusambe kwOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
