              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabaheelesia ababeeli bomuruchi nabakafuna abali injelekha womwalo tsibarwa tsiomunwa kwomuruchi, nabo nibatsitsachisia abandu baNyasaye neinzuye.",
          "type": "text",
